[en.FOCUS_C12_PERSUADE_THE_FAMILY]
Persuade the family

[en.FOCUS_C12_PERSUADE_THE_FAMILY_desc]
Although Maud Pie and Marble Pie have tentatively agreed to let me regain power, this still requires the approval of my other family members. They must accept my plans for the future; otherwise, I'll have no choice but to force them out of the political sphere of the rock farm.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PERSUADE_THE_FAMILY]
说服家族成员

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PERSUADE_THE_FAMILY_desc]
尽管石灰派和玉琪派姑且答应了由我来重新掌权，但是这仍然需要得到我其他家族成员的认可，他们必须接受我对未来的规划，否则我不得不让他们离开采石农场的政坛

